Those chess pieces are made[ from best quality Te]ak[ wood and carved by expert craftsman in beautiful] shapes of chess. Sized in 26 inch[ and] has[ polished] well[ in a set of] dark green[ and] a set[ of] red,[ make] those chess pieces[ looks] colorful.[ Bring] a new nuance[ in] your chess game. Supported[ with the] chess[ board that suit for] the size.[ This] chess[ set] and[ board are] perfect for outdoor game.

